6. The policy I’d establish

I would make this a core principle of the Freedom World Creator Program:

Creator Ownership and Economic Choice

Freedom World aims to give game creators meaningful control over their original intellectual property, transparent commercial terms, and multiple ways to earn from their work.

Creators choose the monetization model that best fits their games. Available options may include conventional game sales, optional in-game purchases, downloadable content, and legally reviewed token-based features.

Under the creator-first partnership model, creators retain ownership of their original game intellectual property and receive the larger share of eligible revenue under the written agreement. Freedom World receives a clearly defined platform share in exchange for agreed services and licensing rights.

Creators are encouraged to develop independent games, establish studios, pursue outside publishing opportunities, and return to the Freedom World community whenever they wish.

All ownership, licensing, revenue-sharing, and distribution terms must be disclosed and agreed upon before substantial production. Participation in cryptocurrency or token-based arrangements is optional.

This is a proposed program policy that should be reviewed by an intellectual-property attorney before we use it in binding agreements.

🌎 My overall take

You’re building something that combines a game development community, an educational program, a creator marketplace, an annual competition, and a path toward independent game studios.

The economic philosophy connecting all of it is simple:

Help creators become capable of succeeding independently, give them fair choices while they build with Freedom World, and welcome them back as their careers grow.

We don’t need every game to become a blockbuster. We need to create an environment where people can learn, make great things, protect their work, and have a fair opportunity to benefit from it.

And if some of those creators eventually build extraordinary games and successful studios, we’ll have helped create the conditions for that success. 🚀